cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use microdonta's observation-design method, please cite the software and associated methods manuscript."
title: "microdonta: information-theoretic observation design for ecological mechanism inference"
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Zhang
    given-names: Ruiqi
version: 0.1.0
license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/zuizui0223/microdonta"
abstract: >-
  microdonta retains ecological mechanism programs compatible with declared
  observations and constraints, quantifies residual mechanism ambiguity, and
  prioritises candidate measurements by normalized mechanism-observation mutual
  information with sequential recomputation after each realised observation.
keywords:
  - mechanism inference
  - causal degeneracy
  - ecological models
  - mutual information
  - sequential design
  - observation design
